            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Preciosa ballet flats<\/strong><\/h3><h4>With petals reminiscent of a wedding bouquet<\/h4><p><\/p><p><strong>Who should be shining brighter than the bride? <\/strong>If you're a fan of glitter, put on the ballet flats we made in cooperation with the dazzle masters at <strong>Preciosa<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Don't the <strong>Preciosa crystals <\/strong>remind you of something? They look like <strong>petals from a wedding bouquet<\/strong>. A little detail that ties you together from head to toe.  <\/p>",
